Subject: [PATCH 05/50] embedded: host bridge for Open settings file and AI
 command search (BYOK)

Open settings file calls window.warpPanelOpenSettingsFile. AI command search (#) works without a
Warp account and asks window.warpPanelGenerateCommands, which the host answers with its own AI
provider.

